rk:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fold_test_preds.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        oof_auc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roc_auc_score(y_train, oof_preds[:, model_idx])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> OOF AUC: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">oof_auc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 简单平均（也可用 Optuna 学习最优权重）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    final_oof </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> oof_preds.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    final_test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> test_preds.mean(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ensemble_auc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roc_auc_score(y_train, final_oof)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">集成 OOF AUC: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ensemble_auc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> final_test</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>小数据集（&lt;2k）</strong>：TabPFN 是 2024 年的首选，ICL 在小样本上有结构性优势</li>\n<li><strong>中等数据集（2k-100k）</strong>：GBDT（XGBoost/LGB）在绝大多数情况下是最强的单一模型</li>\n<li><strong>大数据集（&gt;100k）</strong>：LightGBM 速度最优；有 GPU 时 FT-Transformer 可竞争</li>\n<li><strong>类别特征多</strong>：CatBoost 的有序目标编码是核心优势</li>\n<li><strong>可解释性/延迟约束</strong>：GBDT + TreeSHAP 是监管友好的组合；CatBoost 预测最快</li>\n<li><strong>竞赛最终方案</strong>：GBDT 集成（3框架）+ 深度模型的 OOF 混合</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"tabnet-ft-transformer\">TabNet 与 FT-Transformer</a> · <a href=\"tabpfn-foundation-models\">TabPFN 与表格基础模型</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"深度模型 vs GBDT 选型：决策矩阵与实证分析","id":"深度模型-vs-gbdt-选型-决策矩阵与实证分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实证研究综述","id":"实证研究综述"},{"level":3,"text":"Grinsztajn et al.（2022）：为什么树模型仍主导表格","id":"grinsztajn-et-al-2022-为什么树模型仍主导表格"},{"level":3,"text":"Shwartz-Ziv & Armon（2021）：表格基准","id":"shwartz-ziv-armon-2021-表格基准"},{"level":2,"text":"多维度决策矩阵","id":"多维度决策矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"维度一：数据量","id":"维度一-数据量"},{"level":3,"text":"维度二：特征类型","id":"维度二-特征类型"},{"level":3,"text":"维度三：训练预算","id":"维度三-训练预算"},{"level":3,"text":"维度四：业务约束","id":"维度四-业务约束"},{"level":2,"text":"系统化选型流程","id":"系统化选型流程"},{"level":2,"text":"竞赛实践中的集成策略","id":"竞赛实践中的集成策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TabPFN 与表格基础模型：In-Context Learning 的零样本推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/tabular-ml-gradient-boosting/deep-tabular/tabpfn-foundation-models"},"next":{"title":"特征工程流水线：编码、交叉特征与 Feature Store","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/tabular-ml-gradient-boosting/production/feature-engineering-pipelines"}}